      "issue": "机场代码需核实对应机场。",
      "resolution": "独立核对 AENA 官方机场列表，明确 Sevilla (SVQ)，原登机牌目的地场景匹配。https://www.aena.es/en/airlines/airports-and-destinations/our-airports.html"
    },
    {
      "term": "pcr",
